-2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -6\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{U}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Finding the LU Factorization Using Two or More Elementary Row Operations"}] :topic/math-academy-id 1780 :topic/title "LU Factorization of 3x3 Matrices"}]}
